{"sections":[{"slug":"Lawvere理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Lawvere理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Lawvere 理论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">定义</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span></h3>\n<p>Lawvere <span lang=\"zh\">理论的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/语法范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">语法范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">是满足如下条件的范畴</span> $\\mathcal T$:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>$\\mathcal T$ <span lang=\"zh\">具有有限</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/积(范畴论)","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">积</span>"}},{"Plain":";</li>\n<li>$\\mathcal T$ <span lang=\"zh\">有一个对象</span> $x$, <span lang=\"zh\">使得所有对象都同构于某个</span> $x^n$ ($n$ <span lang=\"zh\">为自然数</span>).</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数理论</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}